---
title: Canvas embeds
---

# Canvas embeds

A `::canvas` block draws a PaperDOM canvas inside a page as static SVG. The canvas
stays a separate artifact, a JSON file here or an attachment in Noma Cloud, so
geometry lives in PaperDOM while the page stays plain, reviewable `.noma`.

## The agent loop {id="loop"}

::canvas{id="agent-loop" src="agent-loop.paperdom.json" page="flow" caption="How an agent edit reaches a page"}
::

## Metrics {id="metrics"}

::canvas{id="agent-metrics" src="agent-loop.paperdom.json" page="metrics" caption="Proposals per week"}
::

## Inline canvas {id="inline"}

Small canvases can live in the page itself, as a fenced JSON body:

::canvas{id="inline-sketch" caption="A two-box sketch"}
```json
{
  "format": "paperdom",
  "version": "0.1",
  "id": "sketch",
  "title": "Sketch",
  "revision": 0,
  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "name": "Sketch",
      "size": { "width": 800, "height": 240 },
      "background": { "color": "#ffffff" },
      "elements": [
        { "id": "a", "type": "shape", "name": "a", "z": 1, "frame": { "x": 40, "y": 70, "w": 240, "h": 100, "rotation": 0 },
          "style": { "fill": "#dfeaf5", "stroke": "#2c5d8f", "strokeWidth": 2, "radius": 12, "opacity": 1, "color": "#1d1c1a", "fontSize": 22, "fontWeight": 600, "textAlign": "center", "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif", "fontStyle": "normal", "underline": false, "strike": false, "lineHeight": 1.2, "letterSpacing": 0, "verticalAlign": "middle", "padding": 8 },
          "content": { "text": "Source (.noma)" } },
        { "id": "b", "type": "shape", "name": "b", "z": 2, "frame": { "x": 520, "y": 70, "w": 240, "h": 100, "rotation": 0 },
          "style": { "fill": "#f4dccd", "stroke": "#b9522a", "strokeWidth": 2, "radius": 12, "opacity": 1, "color": "#1d1c1a", "fontSize": 22, "fontWeight": 600, "textAlign": "center", "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif", "fontStyle": "normal", "underline": false, "strike": false, "lineHeight": 1.2, "letterSpacing": 0, "verticalAlign": "middle", "padding": 8 },
          "content": { "text": "Canvas (PaperDOM)" } },
        { "id": "ab", "type": "connector", "name": "ab", "z": 3, "frame": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 0, "h": 0, "rotation": 0 },
          "style": { "fill": "transparent", "stroke": "#6b6a66", "strokeWidth": 3, "radius": 0, "opacity": 1, "color": "#1d1c1a", "fontSize": 16, "fontWeight": 400, "textAlign": "center", "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif", "fontStyle": "normal", "underline": false, "strike": false, "lineHeight": 1.2, "letterSpacing": 0, "verticalAlign": "middle", "padding": 0 },
          "from": { "elementId": "a", "anchor": "right" }, "to": { "elementId": "b", "anchor": "left" } }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "plugins": [],
  "metadata": { "createdAt": "2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z" }
}
```
::
